  <description>
    <p>IKriate is a digital painting studio with a clean, touch-first interface for tablets and a compact desktop layout for computers.</p>
    <p>It offers a brush library with live stroke previews, independent draw and erase modes that work with every brush, pen-only drawing with finger panning, a gallery home screen, and selectable Desktop, Kriate and Minimal layouts with custom skins and colour tinting.</p>
    <p>IKriate is an independent, unofficial derivative of Krita and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Krita Foundation. It opens and saves Krita documents (.kra).</p>
  </description>
